hine in spite of all  warnings the gangster boss wants to  switch on the machine again which will  lead to the destruction of the whole  city in the final battle the spidey  succeed in defeating kingpin and his  gang of villains united everyone returns  to the universes and miles morales  becomes the new friendly neighborhood  spider in new york  so what sort of multiverse spiderman or  spider women will we meet in the sequel  thanks to the post credits scene and the  first trailer we already know a little  bit of information about the spideys who  will be providing law and order in the  upcoming movie  as expected miles morales remains the  protagonist of the film the young  teenager eventually became the new  spider-man of the city after his victory  over kingpin besides we are all curious  to see how the relationship with his  father will evolve after they finally  managed to get together at the end of  the last film  as has already been confirmed gwen stacy  will also be back after all spider-gwen  ended up befriending miles and it is  clearly hard for her to say her goodbyes  and return to a universe  juan gets female support from jessica  drew who most of you probably know as  spider woman as a young girl she was  seriously ill prompting her father to  develop his spider serum to cure her  however upon injecting it into her she  developed superpowers similar to miles  morales just like him she can send out  an electric shock also known as venom  blast in the comics she first joined  hydra before joining shield whether that  will also be the casing across the  spider verse is yet unclear  we were already introduced to a newcomer  for the second part in the post-credits  scene of the first movie then we see  miguel o'hara also known as spider-man  2099 sad spider-man as you can guess is  from the year 2099 where the world is  ruled by corporations new york is  divided into a rich and poor district  and the time of heroes is long gone  o'hara tries to become spider-man  through the use of genetic manipulation  which he ultimately succeeds in doing  unlike his predecessors he no longer  needs web shooters as he can shoot  threats himself however he lacks the  spider sense of the other spider-man in  return he is able to paralyze his  opponents by biting them  another newcomer is takoya yamashiro  also known as the japanese spider-man  sure we already had an anime or manga  spot in the first movie nevertheless  takoya will be based more on the  original the tokyo boy is an  enthusiastic motocross racer until he's  injected with a serum that alters his  genes similar to miguel o'hara his  powers are comparable to those of peter  parker the only real difference is that  his great weakness is the extreme cold  similar to that of real spiders so far  nothing is known about possible  antagonists which of course leaves  plenty of room for creativity when it  comes to the plot of the second part  thanks to the trailer there's no need  for us to completely guess what the  second part might be about in addition  comics and other hollywood sources also  provide us with clues as to what will  happen next with our spider heroes what  will be clear is that there will be a  love affair between miles and gwen  actually this was already planned to  happen in the first part but then it was  cut out in addition spider woman's  appearance will also introduce a planned  spin-off it is supposed to be about gwen  stacy jessica drew and cindy moon also  called silk  diving into the eventual plot let's  briefly talk about the post-credits  scene once more there a jump is made  into the universe of miguel o'hara you  see a researcher talking about how the  multiverse nearly collapsed the woman  hands spidey a bracelet that can be used  to jump purposefully through the  multiverse this is how miguel heads to  the year 1967 to bring the famous comic  book and meme spider-man into his  reality  as one can see in the trailer the main  characters are a lot older than in the  first movie and are now going to college  that makes it all the more unpleasant  for miles to have gwen show up in his  child's room when he pays him an  impromptu visit from the multiverse they  rapidly travel through the web of  destiny in multiple realities that would  at least mean explanation for the  hexagonal portals that can be seen in  one reality they seem to have arrived in  the year 2099 there miles gets attacked  rather quickly by miguel o'hara better  known as spiderman 2099 who in turn  travels with him through several  realities that like the spideys in the  first part differ in their drawing style  so if we jump to a conclusion from the  images we've already seen the plot could  be as follows spider-man 2099 already  traveled through the multiverse to look  for other spideys to assist him his  reality may be in such danger that he  would not be able to make it on his own  all the whole multiverse might be about  to fall apart again the fact that he  attacked miles upon entering his reality  is not something we would give much  emphasis to he will probably quickly  realize that the miles is not an enemy  in this future superheroes do not  actually play a role anymore and only  live in the stories from better days by  the time this misunderstanding is  resolved spider-man 2099 will already  have the support of at least three more  heroes mild gwen and the already  confirmed jessica drew or spider-woman  there o'hara usually fights against  doctor doom or venom since venom 2 let  there be carnage has just started  streaming we can very well imagine  doctor doom with kingpin's attempt to  mess around in the multiverse the latter  could develop plants of his own to  harness the power of different universes  for himself that would definitely make  him one of the most threatening  opponents because after all even without  that power dr doom is one of the most  powerful villains either way purposeful  travel between universes will surely  play a big part this is done through the  aforementioned web of destiny at least  that's how the heroes travel in the  comics perhaps this will also allow them  to stay longer in another universe which  would certainly benefit the romans  between miles and gwen finally one last  interesting piece of information can be  taken from the end of the trailer the  official title of the film is given the  edition part one and the likelihood we  can expect an epic story that will be  told in several parts but for now we are  eagerly awaiting the first follow-up we  will know more as soon as the next  trailer comes out at the latest in june  2023 when the film hits theaters  so there you have it all facts and  theories about spider-man across the  spider-verse what do you think do you  have any other suggestions on how the  movie could turn out feel free to let us  know in the comments below we are  definitely looking forward to learning  more about miles morales and the  spider-verse  see you next time  [Music]  you

